This is a question to the LVM developers...

Is there a reason why BLKBSZSET and BLKLGSZGET have not been implemented in 
LVM?

Some filesystem tools throw up errors and warnings when creating filesystems 
on an LVM LV because of this.

More information can be found here:
http://marc.theaimsgroup.com/?l=linux-xfs&m=101723646001572&w=2

